  "id": "ss.char.stag",
  "name": "Stag",
  "description": "A survivor of the same brood as everything hunting you — same feelers, same organ, same socket in the shell. The organ is `dead`: no halo, no bloom, a hairline crack across cold grey, and that silence is the premise all eight wear in the same place. The unhatched shell, unchanged, hairs and all — with two hooked jaws out in front of it. The Mandible weapon is literally a bound pair of Soldier jaws thrown and caught, so this is the one character whose feature leaves the body and comes back; they are toothed down the inside edge for the same reason the projectile is. Bone rather than the brown a stag beetle is, because the shell it is attached to keeps its own colour.",
